OL,3,ATigray forces seize main airport in
OL,4,Anorthern Ethiopia from police,
OL,5,Aresidents tell the BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere have been escalating tensions
OL,8,Fthis year between the government and
OL,9,Fthe Tigray People's Liberation Front
OL,10,F(TPLF), the party that runs Tigray,
OL,11,Ffuelling fears of a return to civil
OL,12,Fwar.
OL,14,FOn Sunday, the TPLF announced an
OL,15,Falliance with six armed groups in
OL,16,FEthiopia to remove the government in
OL,17,FAddis Ababa.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
